[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="Document" load_steps=2 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/core/document.gd" id="1_doc"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_doc")
id = &"d03_emil_log"
title = "Lockmaster's log, 1994–98"
byline = "continued in pencil, one hand"
hand = 1
body = "02 NOV 94 — pool 8.7, plant 0.5 hr
03 NOV 94 — pool 8.7, plant 0.5 hr
04 NOV 94 — pool 8.6, plant 0.5 hr

Three and a half years of this. Every day, in the
same hand, the same six words.

11 JAN 96 — pool 12.4, plant 0.5 hr, ringer off
14 FEB 96 — pool 11.0, plant 0.5 hr

09 APR 89 — V.
            (this line is on the wrong page)

16 MAR 98 — pool 20.9, plant 0.5 hr
17 MAR 98 — pool 21.1, plant 0.5 hr
18 MAR 98 — pool 21.3, plant 0.5 hr
19 MAR 98 — pool 21.4, plant 0.5 hr, one coming"
